Hookah Baar — https://hookah.nycanshu.dev

This is a static web app, so your browser downloads all of it in order to run
it. That is how the web works, and it is deliberate here: the whole point of
this app is that the camera never leaves your device. Being able to read the
code is not the same as being free to do anything with it, so here is plainly
what is and is not fine by me.


YOU ARE WELCOME TO

  - Read the code, pull it apart, and learn from it.
  - Run it locally, for yourself.
  - Borrow ideas and techniques from it in your own projects.
  - Build something new on top of it for personal or non-commercial use.

If you do build something out of this, please credit "Hookah Baar by nycanshu"
with a link to https://hookah.nycanshu.dev, and tag me so I can see it. I would
genuinely rather see what you made than never hear about it. A shout-out costs
you nothing and makes my week.


PLEASE ASK FIRST

  - Republishing this app, in whole or substantially as it is, under your own
    name or domain.
  - Any commercial use, including ads, paid access, or bundling it into a
    product you sell.
  - Using the name "Hookah Baar", the wordmark, or the artwork as your own
    branding.

I am not trying to be difficult. Ask me and the answer is usually yes.


